    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[0] = bug_repair: Fix a currency formatter that loses digits and uses the wrong separators in some locales because it routes exact integer amounts through a floating point value before grouping them.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[1] = bug_repair: Fix a conversion from integer minor units back to a decimal amount that drifts at large magnitudes because it divides in floating point instead of composing the exact decimal string.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[2] = bug_repair: Correct the sign and neutral case of a percentage change calculation so a move toward zero from a negative base reads as a gain rather than a loss.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[3] = bug_repair: Make rounding of a scaled integer money value symmetric about zero so negative amounts round half away from zero like positive ones instead of truncating toward zero.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[4] = bug_repair: Replace a fixed window request counter with a sliding estimate so a caller cannot spend twice its budget by straddling the boundary between two windows.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[5] = bug_repair: Stop deriving a per client throttling key from a header the caller controls, preferring the addresses the hosting platform sets, so rotating that header cannot bypass the limit.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[6] = bug_repair: Enforce a request body size cap on the bytes actually received so a streamed request that declares no length cannot bypass the limit.
    codebase_repo_mining.json.mined_task_summaries[7] = bug_repair: Remove a timer started at module import so the shared throttling module has no side effects when loaded in a runtime without timers, pruning lazily on use instead.
